{"unit_id":"Eapp1e__dsh-poker#feature-1","repo":"Eapp1e/dsh-poker","commit":"a142e6c21dd12bc613d179ceb2dd1980971c3d51","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-poker 的功能「开桌与发牌」：调用开桌工具设置机器人数量、筹码、盲注和对手风格，创建牌桌并发出首手；可指定随机种子以便重现牌局。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:897-943","lib/impl.js:185-230"]}
