{"unit_id":"Eapp1e__dsh-poker#caveat-1","repo":"Eapp1e/dsh-poker","commit":"a142e6c21dd12bc613d179ceb2dd1980971c3d51","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-poker 使用 AI 对手时会将其座位的牌局状态发送到所配置的 OpenAI-compatible 接口；AI 可关闭，失败时改用内置策略。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/ai.js:57-70","lib/ai.js:145-174"]}
{"unit_id":"Eapp1e__dsh-poker#caveat-2","repo":"Eapp1e/dsh-poker","commit":"a142e6c21dd12bc613d179ceb2dd1980971c3d51","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-poker 的教练分析使用启发式范围和当前局面 EV 估算；代码提供单局面建议，并非完整牌树求解器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/coach.js:850-870","lib/gto.js:427-449"]}
